---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Reader Resources
description: The worksheets and guides from Retire Right, Retire Now — free to use. Organize your documents, plan your expenses, and turn what you've read into a real retirement plan.
permalink: /resources/
---

{% set resources = [
  {
    title: "Guarding Your Legacy Checklist",
    desc: "Organize every important document, account, and final wish in one place — so your family always knows where everything is, when it matters most.",
    href: "/resources/guarding-your-legacy/",
    cta: "Open the checklist",
    icon: "shield",
    ready: true
  },
  {
    title: "Retirement Expense Plan",
    desc: "Map your monthly retirement expenses with built-in inflation planning — so you know exactly what your income needs to cover, now and twenty years from now.",
    href: "",
    cta: "Coming soon",
    icon: "chart",
    ready: false
  }
] %}

<style>
  .rr-res {
    --blue-deep: #0A3E86;
    --blue: #0A4AA0;
    --gold: #F3C24C;
    --ink: #12233B;
    --slate: #46586F;
    --line: #E6E9EF;
  }
  /* Hero */
  .rr-res-hero {
    background:
      radial-gradient(1100px 480px at 50% -8%, rgba(255,255,255,0.16), transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #1560C6 0%, var(--blue) 55%, var(--blue-deep) 100%);
    padding: 92px 0 96px;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--gold);
  }
  .rr-res-hero .eyebrow {
    display:inline-block; font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .rr-res-hero h1 {
    font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif; color:#fff; font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5.2vw, 4rem); line-height: 1.08; margin: 0 auto 20px; max-width: 16ch;
  }
  .rr-res-hero p {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92); font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.2vw, 1.35rem); line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Cards */
  .rr-res-body { padding: 72px 0 40px; }
  .rr-res-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr));
    gap: 28px; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .rr-card {
    position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    background: #fff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 40px 36px 34px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(4, 26, 64, 0.30); text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6); transition: transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease;
  }
  a.rr-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 28px 64px rgba(4, 26, 64, 0.40); }
  .rr-card.soon { opacity: 0.96; }
  .rr-icon {
    width: 66px; height: 66px; border-radius: 16px; background: rgba(243,194,76,0.16);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  .rr-icon svg { width: 34px; height: 34px; }
  .rr-tag {
    position: absolute; top: 26px; right: 28px; font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue-deep); background: var(--gold); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .rr-card h2 {
    font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.7rem; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .rr-card p { color: var(--slate); font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 26px; flex: 1; }
  .rr-cta {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; align-self: flex-start;
    font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem;
    padding: 14px 26px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--gold); color: var(--blue-deep);
    text-decoration: none; transition: background .15s ease;
  }
  a.rr-card:hover .rr-cta { background: #ffd35e; }
  .rr-cta.disabled { background: #EEF1F5; color: #93A0B2; cursor: default; }
  .rr-cta .arw { transition: transform .15s ease; }
  a.rr-card:hover .rr-cta .arw { transform: translateX(4px); }

  .rr-more { text-align:center; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82); font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 40px auto 0; }

  /* Closing CTA */
  .rr-res-cta { padding: 24px 0 92px; }
  .rr-cta-panel {
    max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(4,26,64,0.32); overflow: hidden;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 0;
  }
  .rr-cta-cover { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #1560C6, var(--blue-deep)); padding: 34px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; height: 100%; }
  .rr-cta-cover img { width: 132px; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }
  .rr-cta-copy { padding: 44px 44px 44px 40px; }
  .rr-cta-copy h2 { font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem); line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .rr-cta-copy p { color: var(--slate); font-size: 1.18rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 24px; }
  .rr-cta-copy .btn-gold {
    display: inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:1.1rem;
    padding: 16px 32px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--gold); color: var(--blue-deep); text-decoration:none; transition: background .15s ease;
  }
  .rr-cta-copy .btn-gold:hover { background:#ffd35e; }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .rr-res-hero { padding: 68px 0 68px; }
    .rr-res-body { padding: 52px 0 28px; }
    .rr-res-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 22px; }
    .rr-card { padding: 32px 28px 30px; }
    .rr-cta-panel { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .rr-cta-cover { padding: 32px; }
    .rr-cta-copy { padding: 32px 28px; }
  }
</style>

<div class="rr-res">

  <section class="rr-res-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Retire Right · Reader Resources</span>
      <h1>Your retirement toolkit</h1>
      <p>The worksheets and guides from the book — free to use and yours to keep. Built to help you turn what you've read into a real, workable plan.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="rr-res-body">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="rr-res-grid">
        {% for r in resources %}
          {% set inner %}
            <div class="rr-icon">
              {% if r.icon == "shield" %}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12 2l8 3v6c0 5-3.4 8.6-8 11-4.6-2.4-8-6-8-11V5l8-3z" stroke="#C99A1E" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.4 2.4L15.6 9.5" stroke="#C99A1E" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              {% else %}
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4 20h16" stroke="#C99A1E" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/><rect x="5.5" y="11" width="3.2" height="7" rx="1" stroke="#C99A1E" stroke-width="1.7"/><rect x="10.4" y="7" width="3.2" height="11" rx="1" stroke="#C99A1E" stroke-width="1.7"/><rect x="15.3" y="13" width="3.2" height="5" rx="1" stroke="#C99A1E" stroke-width="1.7"/></svg>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            {% if not r.ready %}<span class="rr-tag">Coming soon</span>{% endif %}
            <h2>{{ r.title }}</h2>
            <p>{{ r.desc }}</p>
            {% if r.ready %}
              <span class="rr-cta">{{ r.cta }} <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></span>
            {% else %}
              <span class="rr-cta disabled">{{ r.cta }}</span>
            {% endif %}
          {% endset %}

          {% if r.ready %}
            <a class="rr-card" href="{{ r.href }}">{{ inner | safe }}</a>
          {% else %}
            <div class="rr-card soon">{{ inner | safe }}</div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="rr-more">More reader resources are on the way — check back as we add them.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="rr-res-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="rr-cta-panel">
        <div class="rr-cta-cover">
          <img src="/assets/images/book/ebook-cover.jpg" alt="Retire Right, Retire Now by Michael Stevens">
        </div>
        <div class="rr-cta-copy">
          <h2>You've read the book. Let's build your plan.</h2>
          <p>The next step is a complimentary Retirement Money Map — a clear, personalized look at your income, taxes, and the path to the retirement you've been reading about. No cost, no pressure.</p>
          <a class="btn-gold" href="/gift">Get your Money Map <span>&rarr;</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
